      "writtenOn": "2015-04-10T19:10:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think \"preferred\" and \"replace\" are 2 separate, independent things (Michal please confirm.) \"Preferred\" is about order of run configurations, while \"replace\" removes run configurations.",
